OL,3,GNEWSA'We don't want to be the next
OL,4,Avillage lost to erosion'
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents of a Suffolk village say they
OL,7,Fdo not want to see their homes lost to
OL,8,Fcoastal erosion after the frontman of
OL,9,FThe Darkness called for greater
OL,10,Fprotection for the area.
OL,12,FSinger Justin Hawkins called for the
OL,13,Fsea defences at Corton to be replaced
OL,14,Fafter his parents were informed by East
OL,15,FSuffolk Council their home could be
OL,16,Flost to the sea.
OL,18,FVillagers have backed Hawkins' campaign
OL,19,Fand said they did not want to become
OL,20,Fthe next Hemsby - a Norfolk village
OL,21,Fwhere 41 homes have been demolished
OL,22,Fsince December due to erosion.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
