OL,3,GNEWSA'We don't want to be the next
OL,4,Avillage lost to erosion'
OL,5,
OL,6,FEast Suffolk Council said it would not
OL,7,Fbe able to fund replacement sea
OL,8,Fdefences at Corton. Lowestoft MP Jess
OL,9,FAsato said she had approached the
OL,10,Fgovernment for help.
